# Narrative Self (Wave 1b): identity/palli/ is PaLLi's OWN local git repo —
# her story + trail are owner-private and never ride the code repo. The
# CONTENTS pattern (not the directory) keeps the re-include working: git
# cannot re-include a child of an excluded DIRECTORY. The tracked template
# is the shipped care-spine seed every fresh checkout needs — the live
# stake appraiser reads the spine flag-independently (fix wave 2026-07-17).
identity/palli/*
!identity/palli/WHAT_I_CARE_ABOUT.template.md

node_modules/

