# The live configuration. A fresh boot copies data/palli.example.yaml into place here
# (core/settings_boot.py), after which the file holds YOUR knobs and YOUR install's
# shape — it is state, not source, and it is never repo content. The example is the
# tracked one; edit it only if you want to change what a fresh install starts from.
data/palli.yaml
